,"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p006:m0087","surface":"含","start":87,"end":88,"person_id":"skr_sgj_x21","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p006:m0092","surface":"顒","start":92,"end":93,"person_id":"ed0_313_bea","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p006:m0101","surface":"含","start":101,"end":102,"person_id":"skr_sgj_x21","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p006:m0108","surface":"席薳","start":108,"end":110,"person_id":"mw8_fjg_1ic","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p006:m0116","surface":"張方","start":116,"end":118,"person_id":"eti_fp9_fq5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p006:m0129","surface":"含","start":129,"end":130,"person_id":"skr_sgj_x21","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan","book_id":"b-jinshu-060","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-060-lihan-ws2413335"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-lihan:p007","text":"初，梁州刺史皇甫商為趙王倫所任，倫敗，去職詣顒，顒慰撫之甚厚。含諫顒曰：「商，倫之信臣，懼罪至此，不宜數與相見。」商知而恨之。及商當還都，顒置酒餞行，商因與含忿爭，顒和釋之。後含被徵為翊軍校尉。時商參齊王冏軍事，而夏侯奭兄在冏府，稱奭立義，被西籓枉害。含心不自安。冏右司馬趙驤又與含有隙，冏將閱武，含懼驤因兵討之，乃單馬出奔於顒，矯稱受密詔。顒即夜見之，乃說顒曰：「成都王至親，有大功，還籓，甚得眾心。齊王越親而專執威權，朝廷側目。今檄長沙王令討齊，使先聞于齊，齊必誅長沙，因傳檄以加齊罪，則冏可擒也。既去齊，立成都，除逼建親，以安社稷，大勳也。」顒從之，遂表請討冏，拜含為都督，統張方等率諸軍以向洛陽。含屯陰盤，而長沙王乂誅冏，含等旋師。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":74,"last_line":74,"raw_start":6033,"raw_end":6355,"raw_character_offsets":[6035,6036,6037,6038,6039,6040,6041,6042,6043,6044,6045,6046,6047,6048,6049,6050,6051,6052,6053,6054,6055,6056,6057,6058,6059,6060,6061,6062,6063,6064,6065,6066,6067,6068,6069,6070,6071,6072,6073,6074,6075,6076,6077,6078,6079,6080,6081,6082,6083,6084,6085,6086,6087,6088,6089,6090,6091,6092,6093,6094,6095,6096,6097,6098,6099,6100,6101,6102,6103,6104,6105,6106,6107,6108,6109,6110,6111,6112,6113,6114,611